            <h2 type="heading" tag="h2" size="lg" variant="neutral-default" class="text-neutral-default ds-heading-lg" data-ds-text="true"><span id="How_to_Make_a_Withdrawal_from_my_Betting_Account?">How to Make a Withdrawal from my Betting Account?</span></h2>
            <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">As with betting deposits, we’ve made it extremely easy to access any betting wins you make when playing at Stake.com, no matter what withdrawal method you choose. Here are the steps you need to follow to withdraw money from your betting account:</span></p>
            <ol class="svelte-q82j6">
              <li class="level-1 svelte-q82j6">
                <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Go to Account &gt; Wallet &gt; Withdraw</span></p>
              </li>
              <li class="level-1 svelte-q82j6">
                <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Choose from the available withdrawal options</span></p>
              </li>
              <li class="level-1 svelte-q82j6">
                <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Enter the destination address</span></p>
              </li>
              <li class="level-1 svelte-q82j6">
                <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Input the desired amount you wish to cash out and process the withdrawal</span></p>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Visit our</span><a class="[font-family:var(--ds-font-family-default)] [font-variant-numeric:var(--ds-font-variant-numeric,lining-nums_tabular-nums)] [font-feature-settings:var(--ds-font-feature-settings,&quot;salt&quot;_on)] relative justify-center rounded-(--ds-radius-md) [font-weight:var(--ds-font-weight-thick)] whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background transition disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:scale-[0.98] [text-decoration:none] hover:[text-decoration:none] bg-transparent text-grey-200 hover:bg-transparent hover:text-white focus-visible:text-white focus-visible:outline-hidden var(--ds-font-size-sm) inline-flex gap-1 items-center" href="https://help.stake.com/en/articles/5091165-crypto-how-to-make-a-withdrawal" data-sveltekit-reload="off" data-sveltekit-preload-data="off" data-sveltekit-noscroll="" target="_blank" rel="external noreferrer noopener" external="true"><span type="body" tag="span" size="md" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">help page </span> <svg data-ds-icon="External" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="inline-block shrink-0">
