                </svg></a><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">for more information regarding the withdrawal process.</span></p>
            <h3 type="heading" tag="h3" size="md" variant="neutral-default" class="text-neutral-default ds-heading-md" data-ds-text="true"><span id="How_Long_Do_Withdrawals_Take?">How Long Do Withdrawals Take?</span></h3>
            <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">The time it takes for your withdrawal to process will depend on the payment method you use. Bank transfers can take up to 3 business days to process. On the other hand, crypto withdrawals should be processed immediately. If your withdrawal request hasn’t been approved within 3 business days, you should contact the customer support team.</span></p>
            <h2 type="heading" tag="h2" size="lg" variant="neutral-default" class="text-neutral-default ds-heading-lg" data-ds-text="true"><span id="What_Should_I_Consider_When_Choosing_a_Payment_Method_to_Bet_Online?">What Should I Consider When Choosing a Payment Method to Bet Online?</span></h2>
            <p type="body" tag="p" size="md" class="ds-body-md inline-text" data-ds-text="true"><span type="body" size="md" tag="span" strong="false" class="ds-body-md" data-ds-text="true">Before making payments at Stake.com, you must decide the most suitable method for you. Here are some tips that you should consider when looking at deposit methods and options for withdrawals:</span></p>
